OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy cloud 
OL,6,Fdevelops through the evening, with     
OL,7,Fisolated showers moving inland from    
OL,8,Fthe coast into the Moors. Turning cold 
OL,9,Fand frosty where skies remain clear.   
OL,10,FBecoming a little breezier along the   
OL,11,Fcoast and hills by morning.            
OL,13,CSunday:FA generally bright and day     
OL,14,Falthough with the odd shower is        
OL,15,Fpossible at times, these mainly around 
OL,16,Fthe coasts. Remaining chilly inland    
OL,17,Fand slightly breezier than Saturday.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
